Today is Saturday evening.
I am going to Priya's house for dinner.
I will buy something sweet for her.
On the way, I stop at a nice and bright sweet shop.
I say to the shopkeeper, "Dada, give me half a kilo of kaju katli."
The shopkeeper says, "Yes madam, I will give it right away."
I say, "Please pack it in a nice box."
"I will give this box to my friend."
The shopkeeper packs the sweets and gives me the box.
I ask, "How much is it?"
He says, "Five hundred rupees, madam."
I give him five hundred rupees.
I put that box carefully in my bag.
I think that Priya will definitely like these sweets.
Now it is getting late.
I say to myself, "Come on, let's go to the metro station now!"
I start walking towards the station.
